<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Tilted Fixed Background</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f4f9; /* Keyword & HEX mixed example */
            color: rgb(30, 30, 30);    /* RGB Color example */
        }

        .scroll-content {
            height: 2000px; 
            padding: 40px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2; /* Keeps text above the background image */
        }

        body::before {
            content: "";
            position: fixed;
            top: 50%; 
            left: 50%;
            width: 600px;
            height: 400px;
            margin-top: -200px; 
            margin-left: -300px;
            background-image: url('https://picsum.photos'); 
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            transform: perspective(1000px) rotateY(30deg);
          
            z-index: 1; 
            
            opacity: 0.8; 
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="scroll-content">
        <h1>Scroll Down to See the Effect</h1>
        <p>The background image is locked 50% of the way down the screen.</p>
        <p>It is tilted horizontally along the Y-axis using CSS 3D transforms.</p>
        <p>Keep scrolling... it will stay completely fixed in place!</p>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
